% Their 3.3.1: OpenEvolve with GPT-OSS-120B, all 47 tasks, 500 iterations.
% Improvement frequency decays as t^-1, magnitude of the k-th improvement as
% k^-1, both fits R^2 > 0.83 at a slope constrained to -1. All 47 tasks record
% at least one improvement; median 7 per task. Depth beats width at fixed
% budget (B = n x d <= 256, n in {1,2,4,8,16}, 10-task subset).
